---
title: "updateTeamLeaders (stem-system: Team Leader Assignment)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_admin: checkAdmin()
    q_check_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_get_old: admin confirmed
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return error (admin required)
    q_get_old --> q_fetch_old: adminClient.team_leaders.select(member_id) where team_id
    q_fetch_old --> q_delete_old: adminClient.team_leaders.delete() where team_id
    q_delete_old --> q_insert_new: insert new leader records (if memberIds not empty)
    q_insert_new --> q_merge_ids: merge old + new leader IDs (deduplicated)
    q_merge_ids --> q_get_discord: select discord_uid for all affected members
    q_get_discord --> q_sync_loop: for each affected member
    q_sync_loop --> q_sync_roles: syncDiscordRoles(discord_uid)
    q_sync_roles --> q_sync_loop: next member
    q_sync_loop --> q_revalidate: all synced
    q_revalidate --> [*]: revalidatePath, return success

    note right of q_delete_old
        INV-001: leader assignment is replaced atomically (delete all then insert new)
        INV-002: both old and new leaders get Discord role sync
    end note
